        <div class="about-media">
          <img src="assets/images/headshot.jpg" alt="Portrait of Arwa Naalwala, CPA" loading="lazy">
        </div>
        <div class="about-copy">
          <h2>Arwa Naalwala, CPA</h2>
          <p>Arwa is a CPA licensed in both Michigan and Ontario, with 10+ years of experience spanning public accounting and corporate roles. She works with individuals, families, small businesses and corporations on both sides of the border.</p>
          <p>Having lived and worked across the U.S. and Canada herself, Arwa brings first-hand understanding of what it&rsquo;s like to navigate two tax systems at once. Her approach is personal rather than transactional &mdash; she takes the time to understand your situation, your goals, and what matters to your family or business before recommending a path forward.</p>
          <p class="pull-line">You&rsquo;re more than a tax return.</p>
        </div>
